<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #8B5CF6; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
        .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #8B5CF6; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>📝 Signature Required</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Hello {{userName}}!</h2>
            <p>A document requires your signature:</p>
            <p><strong>Document:</strong> {{documentTitle}}</p>
            <p>Please review and sign this document at your earliest convenience.</p>
            <a href="{{documentUrl}}" class="button">Review & Sign Document</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2025 LexNotar. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
